    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\n1. Run `nvim`.\n2. Pick a file with `:Pick files`.\n3. Run `:buffers`.\n\n**Expected:**\n```\n:buffers\n  1 %a   \"init.lua\"                     line 1\n```\n\n**Actual:**\n```\n:buffers\n  1 #h   \"[No Name]\"                    line 1\n  4 %a   \"init.lua\"                     line 1\n```\n\nSeems to be brought about by d1f7e95.\n\n### Reproduction\n\nDefault `mini` installlation, with default `mini.pick` setup.",
